WEBVTT

00:12:58.076 --> 00:13:01.076
Ovdje je bitno da ponovo naučimo

00:13:01.116 --> 00:13:04.196
kako imati ovakve osobne rasprave,

00:13:04.236 --> 00:13:06.436
kada nitko drugi ne sluša,

00:13:06.436 --> 00:13:07.716
sa strancem.

00:13:07.756 --> 00:13:10.836
Ne samo sa strancem kojeg smo upoznali

00:13:10.836 --> 00:13:12.676
putem Tindera za politiku,

00:13:12.716 --> 00:13:17.436
nego i sa strancem u kafiću ili
u teretani ili na konferenciji.

00:13:18.236 --> 00:13:20.276
Molim vas da upoznate nekoga,

00:13:20.276 --> 00:13:21.796
posvađajte se

00:13:21.836 --> 00:13:23.716
i jako uživajte pri tome.

00:13:23.756 --> 00:13:24.996
Hvala.

00:13:25.036 --> 00:13:28.836
(Pljesak)

00:13:28.876 --> 00:13:30.036
Oho!